                                "sense_id": "5c1977ad-9e99-3f58-b591-3de2f6c3d2ba",
                                "text": "Her name was Mabel Hortense, and the children were very proud of having a cousin who lived in the city and was named Mabel Hortense. At Damsonfield Four Corners, where they lived, all the little girls were name Mary Jane or Sarah Ann or Lucy Maria, or, at the best, Hattie and Carrie; they had scarcely even heard so fine a name as Mabel Hortense.",
                                "translation": "Elle s'appelait Mabel Hortense, et les enfants étaient fiers d'avoir une cousine habitant la ville et qui s'appelait Mabel Hortense.A Damsonfield Four Corners, où ils habitaient, toutes les petites filles s'appelaient Mary Jane, Sarah Ann, Lucy Maria ou, au mieux, Hattie et Carrie; ils n'avaient encore jamais entendu un nom tel que Mabel Hortense."
                            },
                            {
